{
  "name": "@example/dsh-examples",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Runnable DeepSeek Harness 0.1.5-rc.2 teaching project: 12 capability modules, 59 service/seam surfaces, offline gates, and optional real-provider paths.",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.18"
  },
  "//scripts": "每个示例由 Node 原生 type-stripping 直接运行 .ts（需 Node ≥ 22.18）。runtime/harness.ts 启动时用 process.loadEnvFile 加载工程根 .env。offline = npm run all（mock，离线）；real = npm run MXX:real；all:real = npm run real:all（58 个阶段全量真实验收）。",
  "scripts": {
    "learn": "node runtime/onboarding.mjs",
    "//scripts": "每个示例由 Node 原生 type-stripping 直接运行 .ts（需 Node ≥ 22.18）。runtime/env.ts 启动时用 process.loadEnvFile 加载工程根 .env。每个模块只有一个 run.ts，**默认真实模式**（provider=anthropic-compat，缺 LLM_API_KEY 立即失败）：npm run MXX 走真实，npm run MXX -- --mock 走离线。all = npm run real:all（61 阶段全量真实验收）；all:mock = 离线门禁。",
    "//real": "真实推理服务请求（默认）：provider 固定 anthropic-compat，缺 LLM_API_KEY 立即失败，禁止回退 mock。",
    "M01": "node M01-tool-pipeline/run.ts",
    "M01:mock": "node M01-tool-pipeline/run.ts --mock",
    "M02": "node M02-context-assembly-economics/run.ts",
    "M02:mock": "node M02-context-assembly-economics/run.ts --mock",
    "M03": "node M03-inference-service-access/run.ts",
    "M03:mock": "node M03-inference-service-access/run.ts --mock",
    "M04": "node M04-agent-loop-intervention/run.ts",
    "M04:mock": "node M04-agent-loop-intervention/run.ts --mock",
    "M05": "node M05-session-surface/run.ts",
    "M05:mock": "node M05-session-surface/run.ts --mock",
    "M06": "node M06-human-in-the-loop/run.ts",
    "M06:mock": "node M06-human-in-the-loop/run.ts --mock",
    "M07": "node M07-execution-backends/run.ts",
    "M07:mock": "node M07-execution-backends/run.ts --mock",
    "M08": "node M08-delegation-presets/run.ts",
    "M08:mock": "node M08-delegation-presets/run.ts --mock",
    "M09": "node M09-long-running-orchestration/run.ts",
    "M09:mock": "node M09-long-running-orchestration/run.ts --mock",
    "M10": "node M10-external-capabilities/run.ts",
    "M10:mock": "node M10-external-capabilities/run.ts --mock",
    "M11": "node M11-config-data-infrastructure/run.ts",
    "M11:mock": "node M11-config-data-infrastructure/run.ts --mock",
    "M12": "node M12-framework-mechanisms/run.ts",
    "M12:mock": "node M12-framework-mechanisms/run.ts --mock",
    "//all": "真实全量验收：12 个模块、61 个阶段（58 逐阶段 + 3 专项演示），全部输出 REAL_STAGE_OK 才算通过。",
    "all": "bash ./runtime/run-all.sh",
    "real:all": "bash ./runtime/run-all-real.sh",
    "all:real": "bash ./runtime/run-all-real.sh",
    "//all:mock": "离线门禁：12 个模块全部走 runtime/llm-mock.ts，不联网、不需要密钥。",
    "all:mock": "bash ./runtime/run-all.sh --mock",
    "//test": "对真实 SDK 的离线冒烟测试与 provider wire 协议回归测试。默认运行模式是真实，所以这里显式传 DSH_MOCK=1。",
    "test": "DSH_MOCK=1 node --test runtime/*.test.ts",
    "//typecheck": "把所有 steps/phases/real/support 直接编译到真实包自带的 .d.ts 上。",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "coverage:surfaces": "node runtime/surface-coverage.ts"
  },
  "//dependencies": "All @deepseek-ai/dsh-* packages are pinned exactly to 0.1.5-rc.2. Cordis/runtime peers are also exact; the module READMEs document the explicit closure and boundaries. M10 的真实 MCP stdio server（assets/mcp-word-count-server.mjs）直接 import 官方 SDK 与 zod，因此这两个包也显式声明版本，不依赖传递提升。",
